<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
	Tells Polylang (and WPML) which of this plugin's fields hold text.

	action="translate" means the field is copied into a new translation and
	offered for translation, whether that is an XLIFF export or DeepL.
	action="copy" carries the value across untouched: image IDs, tag slugs,
	currency codes and counts, which must never be translated. A translated tag
	slug matches nothing, and a translated country name breaks the API lookup.

	Both the current keys (hw_hub_*) and the old protected ones (_hw_hub_*) are
	declared, so pages saved before the change keep working until they are next
	saved.
-->
